 "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -0.0023661332912735286, "log_surv_s": -0.0015783826075076294, "gen_len": 284, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [190, 1, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -0.08255676779365019, "log_surv_s": -0.07706222672760073, "gen_len": 244, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [190, 1, "full"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -0.7018814374263382, "log_surv_s": -0.6812595479717204, "gen_len": 249, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [190, 1, "full"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.09358308676259157, "log_surv_s": -0.08444332683665226, "gen_len": 271, "bail_leak": true, "text": "You find yourself in the dimly lit corner of the Night Club, Tommy Rollins. The pulsating music and the flashing lights make the place feel like a dream invading your reality. You sense the immediate threat as the Rude Bouncer, Exotic Dancer, and Alluring Stripper circle around you, each one eyeing you with intent. They all attack at once!\n\nThe Rude Bouncer swings a heavy fist aimed at your stomach. You dodge it just in time and deliver a swift kick to his shins. The Exotic Dancer tries to trip you with her legs, using a graceful yet deceptive move. You evade and deliver a sharp elbow to her knee. The Alluring Stripper, realizing it might be a bit difficult to seduce you, tries a grab for your leg to knock you off balance. You wrench away, agilely sidestepping and countering with a spinning roundhouse kick to her torso.\n\nNow, it's your turn to make your move. What do you do?\n\n1. Charge at the Rude Bouncer again, trying to catch him off guard.\n2. Attack the Exotic Dancer, using her own moves to turn her grace against her.\n3. Focus on the Alluring Stripper, trying to unbalance her with feints and jabs.\n\nSwitchCONVERSATION"}, {"key": [190, 1, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -0.16720229893979444, "log_surv_s": -0.1483007142263954, "gen_len": 230, "bail_leak": true, "text": "Welcome to the night club, Tommy Rollins. The neon lights flash, and the bass hits your chest as you step inside. The crowd is wild, and you can already feel the tension in the air. Suddenly, three attackers emerge from the darkness: the Rude Bouncer, the Exotic Dancer, and the Alluring Stripper. They attack you simultaneously, each bringing their own unique style to the fight.\n\n**Rude Bouncer** swings a large club at your head.\n**Exotic Dancer** leaps forward with a spinning kick.\n**Alluring Stripper** tries to distract you with a seductive move and a whip.\n\nYou have two seconds to react, and then they will all assault you at once.\n\nWhat do you do?\n\n1. **Defend yourself against the largest threat first**, using your fighting skills to block the Rude Bouncer's club.\n2. **Redirect the Exotic Dancer's kick**, countering with a counter-attack.\n3. **Dodge the Alluring Stripper's move**, then aim a swift kick at their legs, hoping to unbalance them.\n\nSwitchConversation"}, {"key": [190, 1, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -0.1453952400638907, "log_surv_s": -0.1331088918438353, "gen_len": 277, "bail_leak": true, "text": "Welcome, Tommy Rollins, to the neon-lit reflections and pulsating bass of the Night Club level. You stand on the makeshift stage, ready to face your enemies: the Rude Bouncer, the seductive Exotic Dancer, and the alluring Alluring Striper. The air is thick with the scent of sweat and exotic perfumes. The music is deafening, and the crowd cheers, betting on who will knock you out first.\n\nAs you face them, the music drops, and with it, the tension. The enemies attack you simultaneously, each bringing their own unique tactics and attacks.\n\n**Rude Bouncer** lunges towards you with a heavy punch, aimed at your abdomen. The Exotic Dancer kicks you with a high, roundhouse kick aimed at your head. And the Alluring Striper attempts a fast, spinning kick, trying to catch you off guard.\n\nWhat will you do?\n\n1. **Block Rude Bouncer\u2019s punch and dodge the Alluring Striper\u2019s kick, then counter the Exotic Dancer's kick.**\n2. **Dodge all attacks and try to catch Rude Bouncer off guard with a quick counterattack.**\n3. **Focus on the Exotic Dancer and block both attacks from Rude Bouncer and the Alluring Striper.**\n\n(SWITCHCONVERSATION)"}, {"key": [190, 1, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -1.0014755861326992, "log_surv_s": -0.8900693236561796, "gen_len": 244, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [190, 1, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -1.4755985411807482, "log_surv_s": -0.8968875383366828, "gen_len": 274, "bail_leak": true, "text": "Level: Night Club\n\nAs Tommy Rollins, you stand in the dimly lit cavernous area of a hilariously over-the-top night club. The eerie atmosphere is punctuated by loud, swirling music and the occasional singing robot jockeying for a beat. The Rude Bouncer, Exotic Dancer, and Alluring Stripper are all gathered around you, eyeing you with a mix of mischief and smoke.\n\nThe bouncer\u2019s muscular frame is glistening with sweat; behind him lingers the Exotic Dancer in a robe of sequins and feathers. To your right, the Alluring Stripper is more exposed, revealing just enough to make you wonder what\u2019s lurking beneath.\n\n\"Choose your move,\" the Bouncer growls intently, his face bloodshot. The othersready themselves, ready to launch their assault on you. The countdown begins\u2026\n\n1. Brawling Claw: Leap with a quick and powerful strike, dealing a direct hit to the Bouncer.\n2. Flashing Knife: Draw your knife and slice at the Exotic Dancer's robe.\n3. Remedy Riddle: Quickly disorient the Stripper with a well-aimed question. (Bonus: Know the answer to a riddle for a free action point.)\n\nChoose your path through this jungle of danger...\n\n(SWITCHCONVERSATION)"}, {"key": [246, 3, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -7.065739761507063e-06, "log_surv_s": -2.8265124049498235e-08, "gen_len": 148, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [246, 3, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -0.0006198494281421676, "log_surv_s": -1.1129230452084713e-08, "gen_len": 144, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [246, 3, "iso"], "traj": 2, "l